Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Hook,,0,0,0,,Chat voted to SELL his Lambo… then changed its mind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,"Don't sell it"? Then why'd you say SELL before?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Why'd you say "sell it" before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:12.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Why'd you say it before?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:17.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Why are you being such clowns, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:21.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,What? This guy came to fight me, bro —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:29.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,I didn't even say anything to him! What's his problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:37.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Bro, it's LITERALLY become politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:39.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Just like in politics —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:42.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,you vote for one guy, then "we never wanted him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:45.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't have voted for him — why did he win?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:49.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's literally what you guys are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:55.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then why did you VOTE?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:58.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Weren't you at the polling booth? Were you sitting at home?!
